title: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened
route: /denials?id=D-3318
intro: The page for one denial, top to bottom: title, header card with 'Our read', the status banner, the analysis cards, the options and the history. Each card is described once here and detailed in its own diagram.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "A denial is selected (from the list or ?id=)"
process p1 "Title comes from the denial\n'D-3318: Cardinal approved 7 of 14 days. The chart supports challenging it.'"
screen sub1 "Sub line: initials, age · program · payer name\n'The agents read the denial against the chart, and you choose the next step.'"

screen h1 "Header card\nProgram chip, D-id, type pill, status pill, '$22.4K at stake', deadline pill"
screen h2 "Line under the pills\nPayer · case id · initials, age · letter file name\n'Your note: ...' when a note was added"
screen v1 "'Our read' tile, right of the header\nWorth challenging, Borderline or Probably accept, with one sentence"
process pv "Verdict comes from the win chance: 50 and over, 35 to 49, under 35"
screen bn "Status banner (only for some statuses)"
goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened › Status banner"

screen c1 "'What the agents did'\nReader, Advocate and Historian steps, 'Done in 0:48'"
screen c2 "'What Cardinal said': the payer's words\n'What the chart shows': two or three sentences"
screen c3 "'Where the denial is weak'\n'Each finding links to the chart, with a suggested fix'"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened › Where the denial is weak"
decision d1 "Is it an administrative denial?\n'Late notice' or 'Retro-authorization denied'"
screen c4 "'The six ASAM dimensions'\nSix tiles D1 to D6, each with a green, ochre or red dot"
process p2 "The card is left out"
decision d2 "Still open: not filed, not accepted, not closed on a call?"
screen c5 "'Your options' card"
goto g3 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Your options"
process p3 "No options card"
screen c6 "'What has happened'\n'Every step is also on the Dashboard'\nTimeline of events"
process p4 "Done events have a green dot\nScheduled events (dashed dot) read 'Scheduled · Wed 1:00 pm'"
screen r1 "'Open denials' list, right of the page"
goto g4 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Open denials list"
click b1 "Click 'See on the Dashboard' (top right)"
goto g5 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Open and read a request"
end e1 "Person reads the denial and chooses a next step"

s1 --> p1 --> sub1 --> h1
h1 --> h2
h1 --> v1 --> pv
h1 --> bn --> g1
h1 --> c1 --> c2 --> c3 --> g2
c3 --> d1
d1 -->|No| c4
d1 -->|Yes| p2
c4 --> d2
p2 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| c5 --> g3
d2 -->|No| p3
c5 --> c6
p3 --> c6
c6 --> p4 --> e1
sub1 --> r1 --> g4
sub1 --> b1 --> g5
